WEBVTT

00:02:13.910 --> 00:02:18.910
<i>The Demons that</i>

00:02:13.910 --> 00:02:18.910
<i>Lurk in the Moonlight</i>

00:03:11.290 --> 00:03:14.040
Coming straight at me--
is that all you can do?

00:03:14.040 --> 00:03:15.120
If that's the case...

00:03:16.490 --> 00:03:19.950
You'll never become
a full-fledged knight, Kasel.

00:03:19.950 --> 00:03:23.160
What I'm trying to become
isn't a "full-fledged" knight!

00:03:23.160 --> 00:03:25.450
I'm going to become a knight
that can protect everyone!

00:03:25.450 --> 00:03:26.620
There he goes again.

00:03:26.620 --> 00:03:28.660
Always with the big mouth!

00:03:28.660 --> 00:03:31.370
Then you should at least be able to beat me!

00:03:37.040 --> 00:03:39.080
You're too straightforward, Kasel.

00:03:39.080 --> 00:03:41.910
That could cost you dearly.

00:03:43.490 --> 00:03:44.700
Dammit!

00:03:47.990 --> 00:03:49.910
You've still got a long way to go
before you can beat me.

00:03:49.910 --> 00:03:52.540
I'm always one level above you.

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:54.740
You're just taller, that's it!

00:03:55.990 --> 00:03:59.740
I'm going to jump over that...

00:04:01.410 --> 00:04:02.620
...easily!

00:04:10.700 --> 00:04:13.700
All right, time for work, Mr. Apprentice.

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:18.490
Gran, Flegg, you too--get to work.

00:04:18.490 --> 00:04:20.870
I know.

00:04:20.870 --> 00:04:23.950
Dang, so Clause wins again.

00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:26.660
It won't be easy, obviously.

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:29.990
You owe me lunch, Flegg.

00:04:29.990 --> 00:04:36.370
Come on, Kasel. You need be strong enough
to protect my lunch, at least.

00:04:36.370 --> 00:04:38.370
That's not my concern.

00:04:38.370 --> 00:04:41.490
You're honest and a hard worker,
we'll give you that.

00:04:41.490 --> 00:04:42.410
Huh.

00:04:42.410 --> 00:04:46.370
You just need to work on
your stamina and your technique.

00:04:47.450 --> 00:04:51.120
I mean, you're not bad,
as far as apprentices go.

00:04:51.120 --> 00:04:56.080
With Clause training you every day,
I'm sure you'll get stronger soon.

00:04:56.080 --> 00:05:00.580
Okay, and thus, lunch is on you, Kasel.

00:05:00.580 --> 00:05:04.040
How does that follow?!
You're just making stuff up!

00:05:08.450 --> 00:05:10.370
So boring, as always.

00:05:10.370 --> 00:05:13.990
Are you sure you want to be
saying that while on patrol?

00:05:13.990 --> 00:05:18.450
It's fine. If we're bored,
that means it's peaceful.

00:05:18.450 --> 00:05:20.950
Oh, how joyful it is to be bored!

00:05:20.950 --> 00:05:23.740
But you don't have to announce it so loudly...

00:05:23.740 --> 00:05:29.490
Oh, I know. I have to stop by May's place
to make sure nothing dangerous happened!

00:05:29.490 --> 00:05:30.990
Hey, is that...

00:05:34.330 --> 00:05:35.830
A dark elf.

00:05:35.830 --> 00:05:38.330
What's a dark elf doing in Orvelia...?

00:05:51.740 --> 00:05:53.990
That's unsettling.

00:05:53.990 --> 00:05:56.580
Yes, what does he want?

00:05:56.580 --> 00:06:01.120
You're Guardian Knights, aren't you?
Why won't you throw him out?

00:06:01.120 --> 00:06:05.040
Huh? But he hasn't done anything wrong...

00:06:05.040 --> 00:06:09.160
It's a dark elf! Obviously he's up to no good!

00:06:09.160 --> 00:06:13.120
Yeah, they're like
the embodiment of bad omens.

00:06:16.160 --> 00:06:22.830
Please, folks, stay calm. I'll make sure
my superiors know about this.

00:06:22.830 --> 00:06:25.910
It's break time, right?
You go ahead and return.

00:06:25.910 --> 00:06:27.240
Yes...

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:31.660
Don't you worry now. The Guardian Knights
will maintain the peace in this town.

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:37.790
That looks delicious.

00:06:39.240 --> 00:06:41.370
Yeah, it's very fresh.

00:06:41.370 --> 00:06:45.410
For a pretty priestess like you,
I'll toss in another one for free.

00:06:45.410 --> 00:06:47.450
Oh? Are you sure?

00:06:47.450 --> 00:06:49.080
Sure! Take it.

00:06:49.080 --> 00:06:53.370
Thank you very much.
May the holy light protect you.

00:06:53.370 --> 00:06:54.410
Frey.

00:06:57.200 --> 00:06:58.490
Kasel.

00:06:59.830 --> 00:07:02.200
I'm so glad I ran into you.

00:07:02.200 --> 00:07:06.490
I haven't seen you in a while.
I was wondering how you were doing.

00:07:08.330 --> 00:07:13.790
Don't worry about me.
I'm doing fine, and Clause is with me.

00:07:13.790 --> 00:07:16.370
That's good to hear.

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:22.240
I was worried that you'd eat something
strange again and upset your stomach.

00:07:22.240 --> 00:07:24.910
When have I ever eaten
anything out of the ordinary?

00:07:24.910 --> 00:07:27.700
You always do. Like centipedes, spiders...

00:07:27.700 --> 00:07:29.700
There's nothing weird about that.

00:07:29.700 --> 00:07:31.330
It is weird.

00:07:32.830 --> 00:07:38.660
Remember when we were small, you, me,
and Clause went insect hunting until sundown?

00:07:38.660 --> 00:07:43.120
Yeah, we lost track of time and
got dragged back to the orphanage.

00:07:43.120 --> 00:07:47.790
The priest was so mad,
both Clause and I cried.

00:07:47.790 --> 00:07:50.660
But you just fell asleep, exhausted.

00:07:50.660 --> 00:07:51.950
Really?

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:56.620
Yes. Clause was surprised
that you had such nerves of steel.

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:04.290
Kasel, you're working very hard as a knight.

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:07.660
I'm still stuck at the apprentice level, though.

00:08:10.330 --> 00:08:12.290
Earlier today...

00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:19.830
Well... A little incident happened in town,
but I couldn't stop it.

00:08:19.830 --> 00:08:21.080
I see.

00:08:22.200 --> 00:08:27.120
Well, you should finish
your apprenticeship soon, and look sharp.

00:08:27.120 --> 00:08:29.950
I just want to be a knight
that can protect everyone.

00:08:29.950 --> 00:08:33.120
Nothing else matters.

00:08:33.120 --> 00:08:35.370
You really don't change, do you?

00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:44.160
Please enter.

00:08:49.080 --> 00:08:52.080
My king, I have news.

00:08:52.080 --> 00:08:55.240
Behl. What is it?

00:08:55.240 --> 00:09:00.160
We have received word of
Demon sightings in the King's Forest.

00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:01.620
Demons...!

00:09:01.620 --> 00:09:05.290
We will send out scouts immediately.

00:09:05.290 --> 00:09:09.080
We must not allow
a single Demon to enter Orvelia.

00:09:09.080 --> 00:09:11.410
Yes, I understand.

00:09:11.410 --> 00:09:15.450
We are not where we were
100 years ago... If they do...

00:09:17.990 --> 00:09:19.910
I'm counting on you.

00:09:19.910 --> 00:09:21.080
Yes.

00:09:26.990 --> 00:09:28.910
Lord Moriham.

00:09:28.910 --> 00:09:30.290
This person...

00:09:30.290 --> 00:09:33.040
He is with me. Let us through.

00:09:33.040 --> 00:09:34.540
That's a dark elf.

00:09:34.540 --> 00:09:35.540
Yeah...

00:09:35.540 --> 00:09:37.410
What are you waiting for?

00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:38.660
Y-Yes, sir!

00:09:40.160 --> 00:09:42.990
B-But you'll need to hand in your weapon.

00:09:42.990 --> 00:09:44.330
Naturally.

00:09:45.700 --> 00:09:48.580
Demons in the King's Forest...

00:09:48.580 --> 00:09:51.490
Could the Dark Lord's armies be in Orvelia...?

00:09:51.490 --> 00:09:54.290
King Kyle destroyed the Dark Lord
a hundred years ago,

00:09:54.290 --> 00:09:56.950
in the Battle of Galluah Plains.

00:09:56.950 --> 00:09:59.200
That's impossible.

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:01.700
Even if it's not the actual Dark Legion,

00:10:01.700 --> 00:10:05.540
we still aren't sure
how many Demons there are.

00:10:05.540 --> 00:10:09.950
We have no idea how many men
we would need to investigate this.

00:10:09.950 --> 00:10:12.790
Shouldn't we limit the sacrifice to a minimum?

00:10:12.790 --> 00:10:16.540
The size of the force to send
should be as small as possible.

00:10:16.540 --> 00:10:20.790
If none return to give a report,
that would be completely useless!

00:10:20.790 --> 00:10:23.450
Greetings, everyone.

00:10:23.450 --> 00:10:25.120
Lord Moriham.

00:10:25.120 --> 00:10:26.620
Who is this?

00:10:26.620 --> 00:10:30.080
He is my soldier, Chancellor.

00:10:30.080 --> 00:10:32.540
But he's a dark elf...!

00:10:32.540 --> 00:10:37.990
Why would you let someone like that
into the castle, Lord Moriham?!

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:43.410
There is no law barring dark elves
from entering the castle.

00:10:43.410 --> 00:10:45.200
Or...

00:10:45.200 --> 00:10:50.990
Did someone commit the unspeakable act
of making rules without the king's consent?

00:10:51.790 --> 00:10:54.990
So why did you bring him here?

00:10:54.990 --> 00:10:57.790
I have heard that we must
send scouts to investigate this.

00:10:57.790 --> 00:11:02.830
These men, the Black Edge,
should be useful to us.

00:11:02.830 --> 00:11:04.910
Black Edge...?

00:11:04.910 --> 00:11:08.910
A band of fierce mercenaries,
who are growing in fame.

00:11:08.910 --> 00:11:15.080
This man, Riheet, the leader of the Black Edge,
can take on 100 men alone.

00:11:15.080 --> 00:11:16.200
--What?!
--What...?

00:11:17.580 --> 00:11:22.200
I ask you. The animosity between Orvelia
and the dark elves runs deep.

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:25.870
What made you think of lending us aid?

00:11:25.870 --> 00:11:31.410
We are men for hire.
I have no interest in who hires me.

00:11:31.410 --> 00:11:35.490
I see... And what do you ask,
in return for your aid?

00:11:35.490 --> 00:11:39.490
Nothing... Pay us our rewards,
and I ask for nothing else.

00:11:39.490 --> 00:11:44.240
They are simple and clear.
That's what makes them trustworthy.

00:11:44.240 --> 00:11:47.790
They are quite unlike those who, for example,
claim to work for the nation,

00:11:47.790 --> 00:11:51.330
yet concentrate on their own
political or financial gains.

00:11:53.370 --> 00:11:58.120
Chancellor, please,
make use of the Black Edge.

00:11:58.120 --> 00:12:02.240
We cannot allow these suspicious strangers
to take on such an important mission...

00:12:02.240 --> 00:12:06.410
There is no place in the defense
of Orvelia for these dark elves!

00:12:06.410 --> 00:12:08.200
I also oppose!

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:12.990
They are all correct.
We will be the ones to defend our nation.

00:12:14.870 --> 00:12:20.790
As you wish. My apologies
for speaking out of line.

00:12:29.830 --> 00:12:32.910
How can you eat that thing?

00:12:32.910 --> 00:12:35.450
I'm getting heartburn just from watching...

00:12:35.450 --> 00:12:38.080
Whole-cooked spider is quite delicious.

00:12:39.370 --> 00:12:42.490
Kasel eats anything and eats a lot of it.

00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:44.740
If nothing else, his stomach is strong.

00:12:44.740 --> 00:12:46.700
Yeah, sure...

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:49.290
By the way, I saw Frey earlier.

00:12:49.290 --> 00:12:50.290
Frey?

00:12:50.290 --> 00:12:55.580
Yeah, bumped into her in the street.
She's gotten very priestly.

00:12:57.580 --> 00:13:00.910
I see... Good to hear she's working hard.

00:13:00.910 --> 00:13:01.830
Yeah.

00:13:01.830 --> 00:13:05.620
Clause is a knight; Frey is a priestess.

00:13:05.620 --> 00:13:07.950
You've both made your dreams come true.

00:13:07.950 --> 00:13:12.240
Kasel, you'll finish
your apprenticeship in no time, too.

00:13:12.240 --> 00:13:15.040
Well, you always say I still
have a long way to go...

00:13:15.040 --> 00:13:18.160
I'm changing my educational style.
From now on, it's positive reinforcement.

00:13:18.160 --> 00:13:20.290
You should be thankful, Kasel.

00:13:20.290 --> 00:13:23.910
Yeah, Clause's training style is a bit harsh.

00:13:23.910 --> 00:13:25.990
What an understatement.

00:13:27.080 --> 00:13:31.580
Kasel. I'm going off on a new mission.

00:13:31.580 --> 00:13:33.790
You won't be training with me for a while.

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:34.830
Huh?

00:13:34.830 --> 00:13:38.410
We got word that Demons
were spotted in the King's Forest.

00:13:42.200 --> 00:13:47.120
Our squad is being sent to investigate.
Gran and Flegg are going, too.

00:13:47.120 --> 00:13:51.040
Make sure to keep training
while we're gone, all right?

00:13:51.040 --> 00:13:54.240
Do spiders sound good for your souvenir?

00:13:54.240 --> 00:13:55.540
Yes...

00:13:55.540 --> 00:14:01.410
Don't look so glum, Kasel.
This is what we knights are for.

00:14:01.410 --> 00:14:02.330
Yeah...

00:14:02.330 --> 00:14:06.160
Come on, eat up. You're buying tonight!

00:14:06.160 --> 00:14:07.990
Again, why me...?

00:14:09.290 --> 00:14:11.410
H-Help me!

00:14:30.580 --> 00:14:32.700
Sneaking in here was easy!

00:14:33.540 --> 00:14:35.490
That went well.

00:14:35.490 --> 00:14:40.620
Yeah. You had no trouble
getting inside that castle, Riheet.

00:14:40.620 --> 00:14:42.410
Yeah.

00:14:42.410 --> 00:14:47.490
So when are we doing this?! We're going to
kill all the rotten nobles, right?

00:14:47.490 --> 00:14:49.740
You idiot. Think for a change.

00:14:49.740 --> 00:14:54.370
But Tamm is right. If we're
going to do it, we're always ready!

00:14:54.370 --> 00:14:55.700
Yeah!

00:14:54.370 --> 00:14:57.120
Yeah, give us the order, Riheet!

00:14:57.120 --> 00:14:59.160
We'll do it! Bring it on!

00:14:59.160 --> 00:15:00.410
Shut up.

00:15:02.830 --> 00:15:05.490
We just took the first step.

00:15:05.490 --> 00:15:09.950
Yeah. We don't want to get
ahead of ourselves and mess this up.

00:15:09.950 --> 00:15:13.830
We dark elves have been oppressed
by Orvelia for a hundred years.

00:15:13.830 --> 00:15:17.290
We've finally been given the
opportunity to take revenge...!

00:15:18.660 --> 00:15:20.660
We follow you.

00:15:22.200 --> 00:15:27.200
It'll be fun to see the looks on their faces
when we take control of this nation!

00:15:27.200 --> 00:15:30.660
Until then, we'll pretend to be harmless.

00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:33.740
So loud...

00:15:39.490 --> 00:15:42.540
This whole nation will be ours.

00:16:31.160 --> 00:16:33.490
Good, you're keeping up with your training.

00:16:33.490 --> 00:16:35.040
I'm just following orders.

00:16:35.040 --> 00:16:39.490
Right, orders. I guess it's been a while
since the scouts took off...

00:16:39.490 --> 00:16:41.910
They do seem to be taking
longer than they should.

00:16:41.910 --> 00:16:42.640
Yes...

00:16:42.640 --> 00:16:44.700
I wonder if something went wrong.

00:16:46.160 --> 00:16:49.080
Clause is with them, I'm sure they're fine.

00:16:50.040 --> 00:16:53.290
I don't see any Demons anywhere.

00:16:53.290 --> 00:16:57.450
Are we sure those sightings are accurate?

00:16:57.450 --> 00:17:02.370
Who knows? It's possible they saw wolves
or something and mistook them as Demons.

00:17:02.370 --> 00:17:08.080
That sounds likely. I want to head back
and get something nice to eat...

00:17:09.870 --> 00:17:11.910
What's wrong, Clause?

00:17:11.910 --> 00:17:13.330
There's something out there.

00:17:15.120 --> 00:17:16.370
Prepare for combat.

00:17:21.160 --> 00:17:22.660
Let's get out of the forest.

00:17:22.660 --> 00:17:23.910
U-Understood!

00:17:30.740 --> 00:17:32.700
Are these the Demons?!

00:17:32.700 --> 00:17:33.660
Flegg!

00:17:33.660 --> 00:17:34.870
I'm fine!

00:17:35.950 --> 00:17:37.580
Thanks.

00:17:37.580 --> 00:17:38.910
More coming!

00:17:40.120 --> 00:17:41.160
Gran!

00:17:43.410 --> 00:17:44.450
Stay there!

00:17:49.240 --> 00:17:50.370
Flegg!

00:17:54.700 --> 00:17:57.120
Gran, can you move?!

00:17:57.120 --> 00:17:59.160
Flegg, he's...

00:17:59.160 --> 00:18:02.700
I'll hold them here!
You go to the castle and report!

00:18:02.700 --> 00:18:04.990
Dammit... Dammit!

00:18:06.370 --> 00:18:07.370
Go!

00:18:10.450 --> 00:18:11.620
I'm counting on you.

00:18:25.990 --> 00:18:27.490
Nobody gets through me!

00:18:29.490 --> 00:18:31.040
I-It's terrible!

00:18:31.040 --> 00:18:32.160
What is it?

00:18:32.160 --> 00:18:34.080
The scouts are back!

00:18:34.080 --> 00:18:35.580
But there's only one of them!

00:18:35.580 --> 00:18:36.740
Just one?! Why?!

00:18:36.740 --> 00:18:37.790
I don't know!

00:18:38.990 --> 00:18:40.370
Hey! Kasel!

00:18:43.740 --> 00:18:45.410
What happened...?

00:18:45.410 --> 00:18:47.370
Did the Demons get them...?

00:18:57.580 --> 00:19:00.290
I-I'm here to report...

00:19:00.290 --> 00:19:06.990
We encountered Demons in the King's Forest.
Scouts have engaged this threat!

00:19:08.370 --> 00:19:10.740
How many Demons were there?

00:19:11.990 --> 00:19:14.580
The total number is... unknown...

00:19:14.580 --> 00:19:17.410
Hey! Wake up!

00:19:17.410 --> 00:19:18.870
Give him medical attention, immediately.

00:19:18.870 --> 00:19:19.550
Yes, sir!

00:19:19.550 --> 00:19:21.870
We must do something...

00:19:21.870 --> 00:19:25.700
...or else Demons will enter the capital soon.

00:19:25.700 --> 00:19:28.410
We must hold off the Demons,
no matter the cost!

00:19:28.410 --> 00:19:31.910
Let us send more men into
the forest to defeat the Demons!

00:19:31.910 --> 00:19:36.990
More soldiers would just lead to more deaths.

00:19:36.990 --> 00:19:39.830
Besides, now is the time
to conserve our power.

00:19:39.830 --> 00:19:45.160
There's a chance we could see a flood
of Demons like 100 years ago.

00:19:45.160 --> 00:19:47.290
Then what do you suggest we do...?

00:19:47.290 --> 00:19:51.790
Use the manpower I have acquired.
The Black Edge.

00:19:51.790 --> 00:19:54.910
We cannot trust the dark elves!

00:19:54.910 --> 00:20:00.240
E-Exactly! On our honor,
we cannot accept their aid!

00:20:00.240 --> 00:20:02.620
Do not lose sight of what our enemy is.

00:20:02.620 --> 00:20:06.790
Our enemies are the Demons.
When our nation is under this grave threat,

00:20:06.790 --> 00:20:11.040
we cannot waste time bickering
over differences in race.

00:20:11.040 --> 00:20:13.990
Please decide, Chancellor.

00:20:16.080 --> 00:20:19.450
Only Gran returned...

00:20:19.450 --> 00:20:22.080
So... that's what that means.

00:20:25.660 --> 00:20:29.330
I understand how you feel...
but you have to let it go.

00:20:37.490 --> 00:20:38.490
Kasel.

00:20:40.370 --> 00:20:43.990
Frey, what are you doing here?

00:20:43.990 --> 00:20:46.870
I heard the scouts returned, and...

00:20:46.870 --> 00:20:49.580
...that only one of them returned...

00:20:49.580 --> 00:20:52.910
Only Gran came back.

00:20:52.910 --> 00:20:55.080
Clause is safe, right?

00:20:55.080 --> 00:20:57.620
I'm sure he is.

00:20:57.620 --> 00:20:59.830
That's why I have to go.

00:20:59.830 --> 00:21:02.240
Go? Go where?

00:21:03.620 --> 00:21:05.990
To find Clause.

00:21:05.990 --> 00:21:10.330
That's absurd! Kasel, you're just an apprentice!

00:21:10.330 --> 00:21:12.910
If you go all alone, and the Demons attack...

00:21:12.910 --> 00:21:15.700
I'm still going! I have to save Clause!

00:21:15.700 --> 00:21:17.160
Kasel!

00:21:17.160 --> 00:21:20.330
I never want to lose anyone again!

00:21:20.330 --> 00:21:26.160
I don't want to let anyone else
I care about die! Never again!

00:21:26.160 --> 00:21:27.540
Kasel...

00:21:29.290 --> 00:21:30.910
I'm going with you.

00:21:30.910 --> 00:21:31.760
No!

00:21:31.760 --> 00:21:33.240
Yes.

00:21:33.240 --> 00:21:36.870
I also don't want to lose anyone dear to me.

00:21:36.870 --> 00:21:40.660
Besides, my skills as
a priestess should be useful.

00:21:40.660 --> 00:21:42.870
Frey, you need to wait here!

00:21:43.790 --> 00:21:47.290
Clause asked me to take care of you.

00:21:47.290 --> 00:21:49.830
There is nothing you can say to stop me.

00:23:47.040 --> 00:23:49.080
In order to protect those dear to us,

00:23:49.080 --> 00:23:51.200
we took off on a journey and left Orvelia.

00:23:52.040 --> 00:23:56.290
At our destination, the King's Forest,

00:23:56.290 --> 00:24:00.790
we witnessed a sad reality,
and a surprising truth...

00:23:57.950 --> 00:24:00.830
<i>The Truth, Revealed</i>
